{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"update"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entryID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tempo"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming5TempoV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/Tempo","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tempo"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"extras"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools6ExtrasV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Extras"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) -> (updated"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", removedEntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"entryID","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The identity of the entry to replace. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity naming no entry is ignored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"tempo","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new tempo for the entry."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"extras","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new optional extra data for the entry."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A pair of ","type":"text"},{"code":"updated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" identified an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry and it was updated, ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" named no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry and nothing happened — and ","type":"text"},{"code":"removedEntryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity of the pre-existing entry dropped because the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edit collapsed into it (see above). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", or if it is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" but no such collision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"occurred.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/UsingIvorTiming"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/remove(entryID:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" followed by an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps the entry’s identity and does not reorder entries. Reordering only matters when more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than one entry shares a beat time: insertion always lands after every entry already at that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"beat time, so a remove-then-insert edit of one entry among ties silently changes the order of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entries that were never touched. And — unlike a position — the identity keeps addressing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this same entry across any other entry’s edit, so a caller never needs to re-resolve it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edit can turn this entry into an exact duplicate of another one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already at the same beat time — same beat time, tempo, and extras —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same combination "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":" silently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"collapses. When that happens, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"type":"text","text":" always keeps addressing the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entry that was just updated; the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"other"}]},{"type":"text","text":", pre-existing entry is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one silently removed instead. That is the only choice consistent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the guarantee above: a caller invoking this method already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"type":"text","text":" and goes on using it afterward, so honoring “this"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity keeps addressing this same entry” means the entry it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wasn’t referencing has to be the one that gives way, never the one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it was.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortiming\/tempomap\/update(entryid:tempo:extras:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/update(entryID:tempo:extras:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming","doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap"]]},"metadata":{"title":"update(entryID:tempo:extras:)","extendedModule":"IvorTiming","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"IvorTiming"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV6update7entryID5tempo6extrasSb7updated_AC05EntryG0VSg07removedkG0tAJ_AA0C0V10XestiTools6ExtrasVSgtF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"update"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entryID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","text":"EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tempo"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming5TempoV","text":"Tempo"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"extras"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10XestiTools6ExtrasV","text":"Extras"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> (updated"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","precise